      "LocationId": 26965,
      "Actor": "Ghiulhiano Windhill",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I spy a well at the heart of the square, its wooden bucket hanging on a rope, but there\u0027s no work to be done. I\u0027ll take this chance to fish for mussels instead.",
